---
description: InterviewEra serial-only Supabase migrations
globs: supabase/migrations/**
alwaysApply: true
---

New files in `supabase/migrations/` must be `NNN_snake_case.sql` where NNN is
the next integer after the highest existing serial file. Never use
`supabase migration new` and never create 14-digit timestamp filenames.
Never rewrite an existing migration; add a follow-on serial file instead.
Run `npm run verify:migrations` after adding a migration.
